n place of the runs that share one dynamic vertex buffer and the draw order the particle tests pin.", "An alpha test in the particle shader (and its precompiled browser JSON), depth-writing and opaque material variants, and every particle quad and weather streak as a sortable record that joins the world's far-to-near translucent list"),
